Samir: Mobile test notes: reduce chunk max size, prefer small JSON messages, show reconnect pattern with Last-Event-Offset header and rehydrate KV cache. Include sample CLI to replay NDJSON into the demo endpoint.

Lydia: I'll assemble the one-pager: (1) SDK snippets + tiny repo link (2) NDJSON spec + parser (3) security FAQ (4) pricing sketch + throughput demo plan. Review 9am PT tomorrow.

Ira: Great. Quick asks before EOD: Samir -> push example repo and README; Lydia -> draft short answers & NDJSON spec; I'll prepare the SFDC notes and loop in pricing/legal. Thanks :rocket:
